{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use delicious ingredients to prepare drinks and dishes and serve them to the villagers. Make use of a detailed menu system to let them know exactly how many of which product you want to sell so you never get overwhelmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons, find loot to sell, and hire strange monsters as staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your garden so it can provide the best ingredients for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your animals shelter and a steady source of food and water, protect your crops from wildlife, use biodiversity... Everything has an impact in Evergreen Tavern's farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of decorating options to make your place your own. Decorate floors, walls, ceilings, outside and inside... Everything goes and the villagers will love you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735030?t=1768872369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/b66b013504a5d1ec971efac1e5f616288b4362d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768872369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/61ad6487f84b1af5e83e5b72b217ea1670050d14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768872369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/61ad6487f84b1af5e83e5b72b217ea1670050d14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768872369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use delicious ingredients to prepare drinks and dishes and serve them to the villagers. Make use of a detailed menu system to let them know exactly how many of which product you want to sell so you never get overwhelmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons, find loot to sell, and hire strange monsters as staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your garden so it can provide the best ingredients for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your animals shelter and a steady source of food and water, protect your crops from wildlife, use biodiversity... Everything has an impact in Evergreen Tavern's farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.poster.avif?t=1768872369\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.webm?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.mp4?t=1768872369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of decorating options to make your place your own. Decorate floors, walls, ceilings, outside and inside... Everything goes and the villagers will love you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>","developers":["Null Moon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/4b16fbfeca2eab07fb801c92820ac41e5ca0e84f/header.jpg?t=1768872369","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735030/345516962/1962d5d2ab5e80e6edc9d2b326b1ead8c098a540/1768868631/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768872366","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735030/345516962/1962d5d2ab5e80e6edc9d2b326b1ead8c098a540/1768868631/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768872366","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic